{"h":3395,"w":2400,"lines":[{"y":0.097383720787522332,"w":0.057613169352213528,"h":0.013081395583944611,"c":1,"x":0.12962962921278212,"t":"Test 4"},{"w":0.16666666666666669,"t":"Questions 35-39","x":0.12962962951960449,"c":1,"y":0.14098837195231428,"h":0.01453488398216074},{"y":0.17285041234439902,"h":0.017667844522968101,"w":0.76131688435872391,"c":1,"t":"Do the following statements agree with the claims of the writer in Reading Passage 3?","x":0.12962962388620422},{"t":"In boxes 35-39 on your answer sheet, write","h":0.01598837238037687,"x":0.12757201604124693,"c":1,"w":0.39094650268554687,"y":0.20784883706125712},{"h":0.013081395583944611,"c":1,"t":"NOT GIVEN","x":0.19547324849656508,"y":0.27470930219568679,"w":0.11316872914632162},{"c":1,"w":0.45702835083007814,"x":0.33321258253049452,"h":0.017991711871503169,"t":"if the statement agrees with the claims of the writer","y":0.23866299799304347},{"y":0.2572674417231825,"h":0.01453488398216074,"w":0.45061726888020837,"t":"if the statement contradicts the claims of the writer","c":1,"x":0.33333334085060451},{"x":0.33323058552298224,"w":0.49408152262369787,"c":1,"h":0.02010570117245003,"y":0.27181473853757776,"t":"if it is impossible to say what the writer thinks about this"},{"h":0.017477812840042795,"w":0.65843622843424476,"t":"35 The public should be prepared to fund good environmental practices.","y":0.31537102451467192,"c":1,"x":0.12757200941069016},{"h":0.017452131592623599,"t":"36 There is a contrast between the moral principles of different businesses.","x":0.12757203527580846,"y":0.3401060073193295,"w":0.68312754313151047,"c":1},{"t":"37 It is important to make a clear distinction between acceptable and unacceptable","c":1,"y":0.36773255799192006,"x":0.12757201235298263,"w":0.74897120157877606,"h":0.01598837238037687},{"h":0.014821579374890814,"y":0.38555064366724667,"x":0.16820805986441709,"w":0.10188341776529949,"t":"behaviour.","c":1},{"t":"38 The public have successfully influenced businesses in the past.","x":0.12757200850850106,"y":0.4113372091559111,"w":0.60699590047200525,"h":0.01598837238037687,"c":1},{"t":"39 In the future, businesses will show more concern for the environment.","x":0.12752748630181845,"h":0.01807660011857648,"w":0.66059127807617191,"y":0.43582095856366987,"c":1},{"x":0.1296296280426486,"w":0.12139918009440104,"h":0.01453488398216074,"y":0.5072674417056251,"t":"Question 40","c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.01875678557810434,"w":0.34585845947265625,"t":"Choose the correct letter, A, B, C or D.","x":0.1295385572316034,"y":0.54061517448092178},{"y":0.57412790682963644,"x":0.12962963141055014,"h":0.01598837238037687,"c":1,"t":"Write the correct letter in box 40 on your answer sheet.","w":0.48765431722005204},{"w":0.52263376871744782,"c":1,"y":0.60747938768135079,"t":"40 What would be the best subheading for this passage?","x":0.12757200442728434,"h":0.016195524146054185},{"h":0.017189707155081724,"t":"Will the world survive the threat caused by big businesses?","y":0.63223230024372457,"c":1,"w":0.52687973022460943,"x":0.21394207046998417},{"y":0.64958775026564042,"h":0.016195524146054185,"t":"How can big businesses be encouraged to be less driven by profit?","x":0.20370370391478987,"w":0.60905349731445313,"c":1},{"y":0.6671511625797053,"t":"C","h":0.013081395583944611,"x":0.17283950619262209,"c":1,"w":0.016460905075073251},{"y":0.68459302302924852,"h":0.013081395583944722,"w":0.016460905075073251,"c":1,"x":0.17283950620731933,"t":"D"},{"y":0.66532670681393224,"h":0.017660665568249523,"c":1,"t":"What environmental dangers are caused by the greed of businesses?","x":0.21188259053264877,"w":0.62154225667317708},{"x":0.20569588405209865,"w":0.6668681335449218,"t":"Are big businesses to blame for the damage they cause the environment?","y":0.68163020355540938,"h":0.019519162262286449,"c":1},{"x":0.12962962973278971,"w":0.024691357612609877,"y":0.91569767424654513,"h":0.013081395583944611,"t":"92","c":1},{"w":0.020576132138570152,"c":1,"x":0.19341563754623523,"t":"→